IMAPAccount yahoo
Host imap.mail.yahoo.com
Port 993
User axel.boehm@ymail.com
PassCmd "/opt/homebrew/bin/pass show Email/yahoo.com | /usr/bin/sed -n 's/^one-time-yahoo-password:[[:space:]]*//p'"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore yahoo-remote
Account yahoo

MaildirStore yahoo-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.mail/ymail/
Inbox ~/.mail/ymail/Inbox

Channel yahoo-inbox
Far :yahoo-remote:INBOX
Near :yahoo-local:INBOX
Create Near
Sync All
Remove None
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

Channel yahoo-draft
Far :yahoo-remote:Draft
Near :yahoo-local:Draft
Sync All
Remove None
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

Channel yahoo-sent
Far :yahoo-remote:Sent
Near :yahoo-local:Sent
Sync All
Remove None
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

Channel yahoo-trash
Far :yahoo-remote:Trash
Near :yahoo-local:Trash
Sync All
Remove None
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

Channel yahoo-archive
Far :yahoo-remote:Archive
Near :yahoo-local:Archive
Sync All
Remove None
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

IMAPAccount univie
Host imap.univie.ac.at
Port 993
User boehma53
PassCmd "/opt/homebrew/bin/pass show Email/univie-employee | /usr/bin/head -n 1"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore univie-remote
Account univie

MaildirStore univie-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.mail/uniwien/
Inbox ~/.mail/uniwien/INBOX

Channel univie-inbox
Far :univie-remote:INBOX
Near :univie-local:INBOX
Create Near
Sync All
Remove None
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

Channel univie-drafts
Far :univie-remote:Drafts
Near :univie-local:INBOX.Drafts
Sync All
Remove None
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

Channel univie-sent
Far :univie-remote:Sent
Near :univie-local:INBOX.Sent
Sync All
Remove None
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

Channel univie-trash
Far :univie-remote:Trash
Near :univie-local:INBOX.Trash
Sync All
Remove None
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

Channel univie-archive
Far :univie-remote:Archive
Near :univie-local:INBOX.Archive
Sync All
Remove None
Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

Group inboxes
Channel yahoo-inbox
Channel univie-inbox
